IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sgba-nouns`
IMPORT `sgba-vintage`

-- Broadcasting Act 1994 (Singapore), 2020 Revised Edition, informal consolidation in force from 25 September 2024.
-- LAYER 1, PART 1 (continued): s 1 and s 2(2) to (6). (Part 2, ss 3 and 4, is in sgba-p2-authority.l4.)
-- These rules state the 2024 consolidation.

§ `1. Short title`

-- src:242 | 1. This Act is the Broadcasting Act 1994.
@ref s 1 (src:242)
-- The short title names the Act; as a fact about a person it says only what the Act is called.
GIVEN `the name used for the Act` IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 1 the Act is called the Broadcasting Act 1994` MEANS
    `the name used for the Act` EQUALS "Broadcasting Act 1994"

§ `2. Interpretation: subsections (2) to (6)`

-- src:567 | (2) In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires, “part of the
-- src:568 | public” includes —
-- src:570 | (a) residents in a particular place;
-- src:572 | (b) employees of any firm, company or organisation;
-- src:574 | (c) occupiers of a particular building or part of the building;
-- src:575 | and
-- src:577 | (d) members of any profession, club or society.
@ref s 2(2) (src:567-577)
GIVEN `it is residents in a particular place` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is employees of any firm, company or organisation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is occupiers of a particular building or part of the building` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is members of any profession, club or society` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2(2) part of the public includes this group` MEANS
    IF `it is residents in a particular place` OR `it is employees of any firm, company or organisation` OR `it is occupiers of a particular building or part of the building` OR `it is members of any profession, club or society`
    THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING

-- src:579 | (3) For the purposes of this Act, a company is regarded as wholly
-- src:580 | owned by the Government at any time when all the issued shares in
-- src:581 | the company are held by or on behalf of the Government.
@ref s 2(3) (src:579-581)
GIVEN `all the issued shares in the company are held by or on behalf of the Government at that time` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 2(3) the company is regarded as wholly owned by the Government` MEANS
    `all the issued shares in the company are held by or on behalf of the Government at that time`

-- src:583 | (4) For the purposes of this Act, whether any communication of
-- src:584 | content by means of a broadcasting service or an online
-- src:585 | communication service is or is not of a private or domestic nature
-- src:586 | must be determined by having regard to all or any one of the
-- src:587 | following factors:
-- src:589 | (a) the number of individuals in Singapore who are able to
-- src:590 | access the content by means of the service;
-- src:592 | (b) any restrictions on who may access the content by means
-- src:593 | of the service (such as a requirement for approval or
-- src:594 | permission from a user, or the provider, of the service);
-- src:596 | (c) the relationship between the persons that the content is
-- src:597 | being or has been communicated;
-- src:599 | (d) any other relevant factor.
@ref s 2(4) (src:583-599)
-- Whether the communication is of a private or domestic nature is decided by having regard to all or any one of the factors; the weighing is for the decider (asked as a fact).
GIVEN `having regard to the number of individuals in Singapore able to access the content by means of the service, the communication is of a private or domestic nature` IS A BOOLEAN
      `having regard to restrictions on who may access the content, the communication is of a private or domestic nature` IS A BOOLEAN
      `having regard to the relationship between the persons the content is or has been communicated to, the communication is of a private or domestic nature` IS A BOOLEAN
      `having regard to any other relevant factor, the communication is of a private or domestic nature` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2(4) the communication of content is of a private or domestic nature` MEANS
    IF `having regard to the number of individuals in Singapore able to access the content by means of the service, the communication is of a private or domestic nature`
       OR `having regard to restrictions on who may access the content, the communication is of a private or domestic nature`
       OR `having regard to the relationship between the persons the content is or has been communicated to, the communication is of a private or domestic nature`
       OR `having regard to any other relevant factor, the communication is of a private or domestic nature`
    THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING

-- src:603 | (5) However, for the purposes of subsection (4), the following
-- src:604 | factors do not count as restrictions on access to content
-- src:605 | communicated by means of a broadcasting service or an online
-- src:606 | communication service:
-- src:608 | (a) a requirement to log in to or register with the broadcasting
-- src:609 | service or online communication service (or part of such a
-- src:610 | service);
-- src:615 | (b) a requirement to make a payment or take out a subscription
-- src:616 | in order to access the broadcasting service or online
-- src:617 | communication service (or part of such a service) or to
-- src:618 | access particular content communicated by means of that
-- src:619 | service;
-- src:621 | (c) inability to access a broadcasting service or an online
-- src:622 | communication service (or part of such a service) or to
-- src:623 | access particular content communicated by means of that
-- src:624 | service except by using particular technology or a
-- src:625 | particular kind of device (as long as that technology or
-- src:626 | device is generally available to the public).
@ref s 2(5) (src:603-626)
GIVEN `it is a requirement to log in to or register with the service` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is a requirement to make a payment or take out a subscription to access the service or particular content` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is an inability to access it except by using particular technology or a particular kind of device that is generally available to the public` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2(5) the factor counts as a restriction on access to content for the purposes of subsection (4)` MEANS
    IF `it is a requirement to log in to or register with the service` OR `it is a requirement to make a payment or take out a subscription to access the service or particular content` OR `it is an inability to access it except by using particular technology or a particular kind of device that is generally available to the public`
    THEN JUST FALSE ELSE NOTHING

-- src:630 | (6) In determining for the purposes of this Act whether an end-user
-- src:631 | is physically present in Singapore, it is to be assumed that the end-
-- src:632 | user will not falsify or conceal the end-user’s identity or location.
@ref s 2(6) (src:630-632)
GIVEN `the end-user will not falsify or conceal the end-user's identity or location` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 2(6) the end-user is assumed not to falsify or conceal identity or location in deciding physical presence in Singapore` MEANS
    TRUE

§ `Context chapeaus`

-- src:249 | 2.—(1) In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires —
@ref s 2(1) chapeau (src:249)
GIVEN `the context otherwise requires` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 2(1) the definitions in this section apply` MEANS
    NOT `the context otherwise requires`
